FPG monitor live demo, 2026-09-30, Windows, Node v24.18.0, system Chrome.

Setup
  npm run example:build
  npm run example:serve -- --port 4273        # vite preview of examples/vite-react
  node sink.mjs                                # node:http webhook receiver on 127.0.0.1:9807
  node dist/cli.js baseline update --config fpg.yml
  node dist/cli.js monitor --config fpg.yml    # interval 2s, failureThreshold 1

Demo config (fpg.yml)
  baseUrl: http://127.0.0.1:4273
  routes: [{ name: home, path: /, readySelector: main }]
  viewports: [{ width: 1280, height: 900 }, { width: 768, height: 900 }]
  computedStyles: [{ selector: main, property: display, notEquals: none }]
  visual: { baselineDir: ./baselines, evidenceDir: ./evidence, retention: 6 }
  monitor:
    interval: 2s
    failureThreshold: 1
    recoveryNotify: true
    stateFile: ./state.json
    webhook: { url: http://127.0.0.1:9807/fpg, timeoutMs: 3000 }

